What Applause Should Focus On This Week
1. Double Down on Character-Led Reels
Rinku Paaji, Sohrab Handa, and emotionally strong characters continue driving the highest engagement. Lean further into personality-driven edits over plot-heavy storytelling.

2. Prioritise Short-Form Momentum
Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts are currently the biggest growth drivers. Focus on fast-cut, high-retention edits with strong first-frame hooks.

3. Convert Reach into Community Interaction
Views are scaling rapidly, but comment participation can improve further. Add stronger prompts, fan questions, POV hooks, and debate-led captions.

